  "name": "Warband",
  "description": "An orchestra for a goblin raid and the fight after it, from Virtual Playing Orchestra, VSCO 2 and the VCSL ritual kit. Held horns carry the calls, short brass stabs hit the accents, violins run ostinati and tremolo over cellos and basses digging in on the beat, a male choir chants under it, and the war drums are hand drums, slit drums and a gong over timpani. Everything sits in one hall so the cutscene and the battle sound like the same room.",
